    "body": "@Kaiido makes a good point that it needs the same restrictions as `<img>` SVG, so perhaps this isn't worth doing. Supporting arbitrary (styled) node trees without revealing anything about the end user is rather involved and not something anyone has been willing to take on thus far.",
